@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000
@token = replace-with-jwt-token
@userId = 1
@targetEquipeId = 1

### Public endpoints work without token.
### Protected POST endpoints below require a valid JWT in @token.
### @userId must be an existing user id in your database.

### Public list teams
GET {{baseUrl}}/equipes/


### Public read one team
GET {{baseUrl}}/equipes/1

### Create a team for an existing user
POST {{baseUrl}}/equipes/{{userId}}/equipes
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "name": "Nova Team"
}

### Create same name again -> conflict expected
POST {{baseUrl}}/equipes/{{userId}}/equipes
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "name": "Nova Team"
}

### Ask to join an existing team
POST {{baseUrl}}/equipes/{{userId}}/equipes/rejoindre
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "equipeId": {{targetEquipeId}}
}

### Leave team (provide remplacement when needed)
POST {{baseUrl}}/equipes/{{userId}}/equipes/quitter
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "nouveauResponsableId": 2
}

### Promote member 2 as responsible in current user's team
POST {{baseUrl}}/equipes/{{userId}}/equipes/responsables/2/promouvoir
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Demote member 2 from responsible role
POST {{baseUrl}}/equipes/{{userId}}/equipes/responsables/2/depromouvoir
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}


